{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/47-48A2FNH0cNRLT7dvXvA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:44.062026+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/47-48A2FNH0cNRLT7dvXvA","html":"<div><section><section><span><br/></span><section><section><section><section><p><span>武汉大学机器人学院于2025年7月正式成立。学院拥有“081100控制科学与工程”、“080200机械工程”2个科学学位博士点和“085510机器人工程”专业学位博士点，拥有“0811控制科学与工程”科学学位硕士点和“085406电子信息（控制工程）”、“0863S1机器人技术”2个专业学位硕士点。</span></p><p><span>为做好接收2026年优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读硕士学位研究生（以下简称推免生）工作，我院将于近期启动推免生预报名（以下简称预推免）及考核工作。热忱欢迎广大推免生申请我院硕士研究生。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>接收专业</span></b></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/NblIER5Bd8sk0DsfrdeZJLEibstvntedNJEicvZJnVn15vJ4OKfZ0ao9pvKt3p47Hc3juVlnXhSMFmjcCP1ARibGg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/NblIER5Bd8sk0DsfrdeZJLEibstvntedNoOwKibm28etOTx3DicciaM9QD0YBqHxsQWVaEGwkVvKtibUvib8bUpicm1Vg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>我院全日制学术学位硕士研究生（0811控制科学与工程、0802机械工程）及全日制专业学位硕士研究生（085406电子信息（控制工程）、0863S1机器人技术）均接收推免生。接收推免生指标待学校正式下达招生计划后公布。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/NblIER5Bd8sk0DsfrdeZJLEibstvntedNmfTtwwyibCQZZY19WvVcuEQmTfXxTTuxgsRsZ9vb9AzvSib6CF8pt5lg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>接收条件</span></b></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/NblIER5Bd8sk0DsfrdeZJLEibstvntedNJEicvZJnVn15vJ4OKfZ0ao9pvKt3p47Hc3juVlnXhSMFmjcCP1ARibGg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/NblIER5Bd8sk0DsfrdeZJLEibstvntedNoOwKibm28etOTx3DicciaM9QD0YBqHxsQWVaEGwkVvKtibUvib8bUpicm1Vg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1．拥护党的领导，愿为国家建设服务，品德良好，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></p><p><span>2．优先接收来自全国“双一流”高校的机器人工程、自动化、导航工程、机械工程及其自动化、机械电子工程、智能制造工程、电气工程及其自动化和电子信息工程等相关专业的优秀应届本科毕业生。也鼓励相关“双一流”高校数学、物理、计算机科学与技术、人工智能、遥感信息工程、材料科学与工程、通信工程的跨学科优秀应届本科生报名。申请人应在今年9月取得所在学校的推免生资格。</span></p><p><span>3．学习成绩优良，综合成绩名列前茅。</span></p><p><span>4. 在校期间曾参加过课外科研学术活动或全国竞赛等，表现突出者优先考虑。</span></p><p><span>5．本科期间须无任何处分记录。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料准备</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/NblIER5Bd8sk0DsfrdeZJLEibstvntedNJEicvZJnVn15vJ4OKfZ0ao9pvKt3p47Hc3juVlnXhSMFmjcCP1ARibGg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/NblIER5Bd8sk0DsfrdeZJLEibstvntedNoOwKibm28etOTx3DicciaM9QD0YBqHxsQWVaEGwkVvKtibUvib8bUpicm1Vg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/NblIER5Bd8sk0DsfrdeZJLEibstvntedNlIRwvzEhOEcyMsLA1xfcrfVvZtwbeFc3oJMt9231A0YCRYZFHgoM9A/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>《武汉大学机器人学院2026年推荐免试硕士研究生预报名申请表》</span></strong><span>（以下简称《申请表》，</span><strong><span>附件1</span></strong><span>），《申请表》上须有本人亲笔签名、所在院系推荐意见和学校教务部门盖章。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/NblIER5Bd8sk0DsfrdeZJLEibstvntedNlIRwvzEhOEcyMsLA1xfcrfVvZtwbeFc3oJMt9231A0YCRYZFHgoM9A/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>《武汉大学机器人学院2026年推荐免试硕士研究生预报名个人陈述》</span></strong><span>(以下简称《个人陈述》，</span><strong><span>附件2</span></strong><span>)，需本人亲笔签名。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>3</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/NblIER5Bd8sk0DsfrdeZJLEibstvntedNlIRwvzEhOEcyMsLA1xfcrfVvZtwbeFc3oJMt9231A0YCRYZFHgoM9A/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>《武汉大学机器人学院2026年推荐免试硕士研究生预报名选拔考核承诺书》</span></strong><span>（以下简称《承诺书》，</span><strong><span>附件3</span></strong><span>），需有本人亲笔签名。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>4</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/NblIER5Bd8sk0DsfrdeZJLEibstvntedNlIRwvzEhOEcyMsLA1xfcrfVvZtwbeFc3oJMt9231A0YCRYZFHgoM9A/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>《武汉大学机器人学院2026年推荐免试硕士研究生预报名成果简表》</span></strong><span>（以下简称《成果简表》，</span><strong><span>附件4</span></strong><span>，以“成果简表-姓名”命名）。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>5</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/NblIER5Bd8sk0DsfrdeZJLEibstvntedNlIRwvzEhOEcyMsLA1xfcrfVvZtwbeFc3oJMt9231A0YCRYZFHgoM9A/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他材料：</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>①</span></strong><span>身份证、学生证复印件（复印在A4纸的同一页面上）；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>②</span></strong><span>前6个学期的大学学习成绩单原件，须加盖申请者本人所在单位教务部门的学习成绩专用章。A3幅面的成绩单请按照A4幅面分页扫描，确保姓名、学号、课程名称及成绩显示清晰；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>③</span></strong><span>申请人所在学院（系）出具的前6个学期专业成绩排名以及年级总人数情况证明；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>④</span></strong><span>英语水平证明：国家英语四、六级考试成绩或TOEFL/GRE/GMAT/IELTS成绩单等；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>⑤</span></strong><span>体现自身学术水平的代表性学术论文、专利、出版物或原创性成果，其他各类证书（期刊论文须附上封面、目录和文章全文，出版物著作等须附上封面、目录)；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>⑥</span></strong><span>各类获奖证书等。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>材料提交要求：</span></strong><span>附件1、附件2、附件3、附件4、“其他材料”。</span></p><p><strong><span>注意：</span></strong></p><p><span>1.附件1、附件2、附件3、附件4以“报名号-申报专业-‘附件简称’-姓名”命名；</span></p></section><section><p><span>2.“其他材料”扫描时纸张需摆放端正，统一方向，扫描文字、图片需清晰，整理为一个PDF彩色文件，以“报名号-申报专业-就读学校名称-姓名.PDF”命名）。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>4</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>考核录取</span></b></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/NblIER5Bd8sk0DsfrdeZJLEibstvntedNJEicvZJnVn15vJ4OKfZ0ao9pvKt3p47Hc3juVlnXhSMFmjcCP1ARibGg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/NblIER5Bd8sk0DsfrdeZJLEibstvntedNoOwKibm28etOTx3DicciaM9QD0YBqHxsQWVaEGwkVvKtibUvib8bUpicm1Vg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1.预推免考核时间定于9月下旬，具体时间、地点、形式（线上、线下）请关注学院发布的正式预推免通知。</span></p><p><span>2.考核分三个部分进行，即：背景评估、英语面试及综合面试：</span></p><p><span>（1）背景评估：根据申请人提交的申请材料进行评估，包括：考生的教育背景，学习成绩及排名等情况。</span></p><p><span>（2）英语面试：测试考生英语听说读写及应用能力。</span></p><p><span>（3）综合面试：包括心理素质及专业能力，主要测试考生的心理素质、掌握本专业系统知识的情况、攻读硕士学位的目的与科研计划等。重在考查学生的学术基础、运用所学知识的能力、科研创新能力（专业能力倾向）以及对本学科前沿领域及最新研究动态的掌握情况等。</span></p><p><span>3.考核综合成绩计算：考核综合成绩、背景评估成绩、英语面试及综合面试成绩均为百分制。考核综合成绩＝背景评估×30%＋英语面试×20%+综合面试×50%。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>5</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>其他事项</span></b></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/NblIER5Bd8sk0DsfrdeZJLEibstvntedNJEicvZJnVn15vJ4OKfZ0ao9pvKt3p47Hc3juVlnXhSMFmjcCP1ARibGg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/NblIER5Bd8sk0DsfrdeZJLEibstvntedNoOwKibm28etOTx3DicciaM9QD0YBqHxsQWVaEGwkVvKtibUvib8bUpicm1Vg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1.所有拟申请武汉大学机器人学院推免生预报名的同学，请以“学校+姓名”实名加入QQ群：280096936，留意群内通知。</span></p><p><span>2.我院相关线上宣传宣讲活动的时间、方式将在QQ群内公布。</span></p><p><span>3.我院将根据教育部和学校最新推免生政策，及时公布2026年接收推免生的工作实施细则和正式预推免报名通知等，敬请及时关注相关信息。未尽事宜以我院2026年接收推免生实施细则为准。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>联 系 人：王老师</span></p><p><span>联系邮件：whsnowgirl@whu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>武汉大学机器人学院</span></p><p><span>2025年7月26日</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/47-48A2FNH0cNRLT7dvXvA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1：武汉大学机器人学院2026年推荐免试硕士研究生预报名申请表</a></span></section><section><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/47-48A2FNH0cNRLT7dvXvA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件2：武汉大学机器人学院2026年推荐免试硕士研究生预报名个人陈述</a></span></section><section><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/47-48A2FNH0cNRLT7dvXvA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件3：武汉大学机器人学院2026年推荐免试硕士研究生预报名选拔考核承诺书</a></span></section><section><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/47-48A2FNH0cNRLT7dvXvA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件4：武汉大学机器人学院2026年推荐免试硕士研究生预报名成果简表</a></span></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"12f77eb85d2fa83aa41342341637f089d634341be252ab544dcb09ac5a9a71ad","textLength":2058,"sourceSha256":"0351d4eeb40578b1f2218e014fdcbff467c527c66790f3a8bb65559dc4485b10","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-4450bbeb701fd6106cd3","title":"2025年武汉大学机器人学院2026年预推免工作预备通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:44.062026+00:00"}
